        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Labatt Open\n- Companies: Labatt Brewing Company, Mill Street Brewery, Anheuser–Busch InBev\n- Places: Canada\n- Topics: PGA Tour, brewing\n\nFacts:\n- The Labatt Open was a golf event on the PGA Tour that was played in Canada in the mid-1950s.\n- The Labatt Open was sponsored by the Labatt Brewing Company.\n- Labatt Brewing Company is the largest brewer in Canada.\n- In 2015, Labatt Brewing Company purchased Mill Street Brewery.\n- Anheuser–Busch InBev owns Labatt Brewing Company.",
